# Path of Exile: Templar Hierophant Build & Progression Guide

## 1. Character & Build Context
* **Class/Ascendancy:** Templar Hierophant (6/8 Ascendancy points allocated)
* **Current Level:** 76
* **Current Progression:** Map Tier 4 (Transitioning from White to Yellow Maps)
* **Main Skill:** Kinetic Fusillade Ballista Totem

---

## 2. Core Build Mechanics & Breakpoints
### The "Gatling Gun" Attack Speed Constraint
Kinetic Fusillade requires careful management of attack speed versus skill duration to avoid canceling totem attack sequences.
* **The Rule:** Ballista Totem **Attack Time** must be *longer* than the total **Projectile Duration**.
* **The Fix:** Always run **Less Duration Support**. Do not stack excessive attack speed on gear/passives. The inherent 50% less attack speed penalty from Ballista Totem Support naturally helps maintain this balance.

### Core Gem Links (4-Link to 5-Link Transition)
* **4-Link Setup (Current Baseline):**
  `Kinetic Fusillade` ➔ `Ballista Totem` ➔ `Less Duration` ➔ `Greater Volley`
* **5-Link Upgrade (Priority for T6+):**
  Add `Elemental Damage with Attacks Support` (massive flat damage multiplier).

